PROJECT 'BOX' '001'
$ Slope: 50 x 20 cells of 500 m, 25 m deep in the west to 3 m in the east, with the
$ physics of the operational so-rp deck (wind 20 m/s from 300 degrees).
SET LEVEL 0.0 CDCAP=0.00275 NAUTICAL
MODE STATIONARY TWODIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES CARTESIAN
CGRID REGULAR 0. 0. 0. 25000.0 10000.0 50 20 CIRCLE MDC=36 FLOW=0.03 FHIGH=1.0
INPGRID BOTTOM REGULAR 0. 0. 0. 1 1 25000.0 10000.0
READINP BOTTOM 1.0 'box.bot' 1 0 FREE
WIND 20.0 300.0
BOUND SHAPESPEC JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE WEST CONSTANT PAR 3.65 7.41 300.0 25.0
GEN3 KOMEN
WCAP KOMEN DELTA=1
BREAKING CONSTANT 1.0 0.73
FRICTION JONSWAP CONSTANT 0.038
TRIAD ITRIAD=1 TRFAC=0.8 CUTFR=2.5
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEADER 'hs.blk' LAYOUT 3 HSIGN
BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEADER 'tm.blk' LAYOUT 3 TM01
NUMERIC STOPC NPNTS=101 STAT MXITST=50 RESIDUAL 0
COMPUTE
STOP
